workedExample:
Track the kept set (root = max):

```
5: push        {5}
1: push        {1, 5}  root 5
9: 9 < 5? no   ignore
3: 3 < 5? yes  replace -> {1, 3}
7: 7 < 3? no   ignore
2: 2 < 3? yes  replace -> {1, 2}
```

Result `[1, 2]`, with 2 calls to `heapreplace`. Each replacement costs O(log k); each rejection costs one comparison.
